team/apps/3794620/extras/7015475260a932572d6fc025ef4d6914.avif?t=1754403950\" width=616 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/05219b6177cf5dd5c5682d1cbdf41484.poster.avif?t=1754403950\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/05219b6177cf5dd5c5682d1cbdf41484.webm?t=1754403950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794620/extras/05219b6177cf5dd5c5682d1cbdf41484.mp4?t=1754403950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your world from the ground up. Build coastal bases, island forts, or hidden hideouts with your crew. Craft anything from weapons and armor to tools and ship upgrades. Fortify your base, set traps, and prepare for enemy raids. Whether you're the builder or a fighter, survival starts with what you create.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft weapons, tools, armor and ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct your fortress</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form a crew with friends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build traps and fortifications</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
